"When I asked @BarackObama if aliens exist, his answer was essentially, 'yes they exist, but we don't have any evidence of it--'"

@neiltyson: "Because he's scientifically literate... He's citing what any scientist would tell you about the likelihood of life in the universe. But because he was president, people want to read into it on levels that were out of control."

